+During this time the encounter status itself might be marked as "on-hold". 
+Local systems may have multiple different types of leave/hold and these can use appropriate combinations fo the status/subjectStatus fields to represent this.<br/>
 The location is also likely to be filled in with a location status of "active".<br/>
